      x: '<p><b class="rd">might, may, could</b> — <b>ehtimol</b> (50%): «He <b class="rd">might be</b> the thief. I’m not sure.»</p><p>Ehtimol emas: <b class="rd">might not / may not</b>: «She <b>might not</b> know.» Lekin <b>could not (couldn’t)</b> ehtimol emas — u <b>can’t</b> ga yaqin (aniq mumkin emas).</p><p>Davom etayotgan ish: <b>might be + V-ing</b>: «They <b>might be hiding</b> somewhere.»</p>',
